# Keep runtime service state and git history out of the ../.. (~/Projects)
# Docker build context used by ucla-tdg-email-triage compose. This file
# deploys to ~/Projects/.dockerignore (see "Docker ignore" in
# docs/instruction-architecture.md) and only governs builds whose
# context: is ../.. — it does NOT reach the separate context:
# ../../jk/jk-email-agents build (Docker looks for .dockerignore at that
# context's own root, not a parent directory's). That context already has
# its own tracked jk-email-agents/.dockerignore with equivalent data/ and
# .git/ rules, committed separately in that repo.
# Added 2026-08-12 during the Postmaster cutover; tracked here so a fresh
# machine's ~/Projects gets it (ucla-tdg-email-triage#23).
#
# The jk/jk-email-agents/data/ line below still matters here: the ../..
# context covers the whole workspace, including the jk-email-agents
# subtree, for the ucla-tdg-next-email / ucla-tdg-inbox-triage /
# ucla-tdg-contact-resolver builds.
jk/jk-email-agents/data/
ucla-tdg/ucla-tdg-email-triage/data/
.git/
**/.git/
